  "description": "Gyo-ha becomes a disciple of the Kunlun Sect, which was once numbered among the legendary Nine Sects and One Gang. Together with his fellow disciples, he struggles against all odds to rebuild the fallen sect.\n\n...Except, something is a bit off.\n\nHis fellow disciples are former beggars, bandits, swindlers, and thieves?\n\nIs this… *really* an orthodox sect?\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12472709) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=852601), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14449210)",
